From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QED64 Toolchain <qed64-toolchain@localhost>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:42:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] build: refresh the explicit Emscripten export list
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The interpreter's dlsym contract is an explicit -sEXPORTED_FUNCTIONS list
(every l_*___boxed wrapper, module initializers, @[export] stems, C runtime
symbols). The entries changed here track the debug-instrumentation removal
in the previous commit: symbols renamed or eliminated by deleting the
[DEBUG:*] code paths. The list is otherwise unchanged from the wasm32
generation — the boxed-wrapper ABI is pointer-width-generic.

Upstreaming: regenerate rather than merge — the list is a build artifact;
what belongs upstream is its generator.
---
